{"evt":"knowledge_added","id":"note-mqigy8kw6v2","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","item":"Codex hook relays wrap shared Claude-style hooks; denied inner hooks must be translated to `permissionDecision: deny`, not allowed by an empty stdout result.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-17T19:33:33.535Z"}
{"evt":"knowledge_added","id":"note-mqigy8kw6v2","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","item":"In Bash, `$?` after an `if ...; then ...; fi` compound statement may not be the failed condition's status; capture the pipeline status in `else` before checking for exit 2.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-17T19:33:33.535Z"}
